{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyper Tanks</strong> is an action-packed arena shooter with futuristic Tanks! Pick one of various Tank classes, embark on challenging <strong>Singleplayer campaigns</strong> and beat up your friends in fun <strong>Multiplayer modes</strong>! Dodge incoming fire, make your shots bounce around corners and deploy Special Weapons to dominate your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/4839c568159ce1ea43530cc335c947bd.poster.avif?t=1772157939\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/4839c568159ce1ea43530cc335c947bd.webm?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/4839c568159ce1ea43530cc335c947bd.mp4?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your Tank from the tactical <strong>top-down</strong> perspective, or immerse yourself in the action with the <strong>3rd person</strong> perspective. The cool part: You can switch between both perspectives at <strong>any time</strong> with the press of a button. The Tank controls automatically adjust to the current view mode. <i>[in matches with multiple human players the game can only be played in top-down perspective]</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/5b60b19451acbe0095be8b89141d1091.poster.avif?t=1772157939\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/5b60b19451acbe0095be8b89141d1091.webm?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/5b60b19451acbe0095be8b89141d1091.mp4?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy hordes of enemies in epic <strong>Campaigns</strong>, either as <strong>Single Player</strong> or in <strong>Co-op</strong>! Don't lose all lives or your campaign run starts over again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety:</strong> No run will be the same as you choose your own path through a randomized mission tree. Missions will have different objectives, level layouts and enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Choose a unique Tank with distinct traits and Abilities at the start of each run. Upgrade your Tank on your way through the Campaign to increase your odds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics:</strong> Sneak up on enemies from behind, bounce your shots around corners or use Powerups and Special Weapons to gain the upper hand. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles:</strong> Each campaign ends with an epic Boss fight that will test your skills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/fdf4f6d62d96a5f9fc91c32d58559cdb.poster.avif?t=1772157939\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/fdf4f6d62d96a5f9fc91c32d58559cdb.webm?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/fdf4f6d62d96a5f9fc91c32d58559cdb.mp4?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat up your friends or CPU players in action packed <strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong> for up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many modes</strong>: Play different modes with unique rules and objectives, including classics like Deathmatch or Capture the Flag! Some modes can be played both as Free For All and as Team Battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online &amp; Offline</strong>: Battle your friends in local couch multiplayer, or invite your online Steam friends to join you via <i>Steam Remote Play</i>! Your friends do not even need to own the game to join the fun. <i>[other players need a Controller to play]</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CPU players</strong>: All modes can be played with or against capable CPU players. You can control their difficulty settings and even give commands to your CPU allies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/58d2732f6a3e44b2fcd8fa198408fc59.poster.avif?t=1772157939\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/58d2732f6a3e44b2fcd8fa198408fc59.webm?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/58d2732f6a3e44b2fcd8fa198408fc59.mp4?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the <strong>Tank</strong> that suits your playstyle or master them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique traits:</strong> Every Tank has unique stats, traits, movement methods and weaponry. They all feel different to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Abilities:</strong> All Tanks have unique inherent Abilities, from a Charged Shot over a Defense Drone to a short-range Teleport. Use them in key moments to surprise your foes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/3fc38a9f89bb126e1f64fc47090a3cba.poster.avif?t=1772157939\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/3fc38a9f89bb126e1f64fc47090a3cba.webm?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/3fc38a9f89bb126e1f64fc47090a3cba.mp4?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of many different <strong>Special Weapons</strong> to customize your Tank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate:</strong> Treat your Special Weapon like an Ultimate Ability. It has a long cooldown, but can dramatically change the outcome of battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety:</strong> There are many Special Weapons to choose from, such as a Defense Turret, a Fireball, an EMP or a Tornado, and more. Oh, and of course there is a Grappling Hook, because every game needs one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/11e8ff6e72d2fb74df24e48fb05c62a9.webp?t=1772157939\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p>","background":"h