line &amp; Offline</strong>: Battle your friends in local couch multiplayer, or invite your online Steam friends to join you via <i>Steam Remote Play</i>! Your friends do not even need to own the game to join the fun. <i>[other players need a Controller to play]</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CPU players</strong>: All modes can be played with or against capable CPU players. You can control their difficulty settings and even give commands to your CPU allies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/58d2732f6a3e44b2fcd8fa198408fc59.poster.avif?t=1772157939\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/58d2732f6a3e44b2fcd8fa198408fc59.webm?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/58d2732f6a3e44b2fcd8fa198408fc59.mp4?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the <strong>Tank</strong> that suits your playstyle or master them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique traits:</strong> Every Tank has unique stats, traits, movement methods and weaponry. They all feel different to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Abilities:</strong> All Tanks have unique inherent Abilities, from a Charged Shot over a Defense Drone to a short-range Teleport. Use them in key moments to surprise your foes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/3fc38a9f89bb126e1f64fc47090a3cba.poster.avif?t=1772157939\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/3fc38a9f89bb126e1f64fc47090a3cba.webm?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/3fc38a9f89bb126e1f64fc47090a3cba.mp4?t=1772157939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of many different <strong>Special Weapons</strong> to customize your Tank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate:</strong> Treat your Special Weapon like an Ultimate Ability. It has a long cooldown, but can dramatically change the outcome of battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety:</strong> There are many Special Weapons to choose from, such as a Defense Turret, a Fireball, an EMP or a Tornado, and more. Oh, and of course there is a Grappling Hook, because every game needs one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/11e8ff6e72d2fb74df24e48fb05c62a9.webp?t=1772157939\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p>","developers":["Mousecore Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/61d8cd5455c8e613562c643dc675075f93628186/header.jpg?t=1772157939","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2615150/1677283291/14d53d9f3011e6bdbbb7acf9f4f8a650425f789f/1750936568/dash_a